\ 外设定义
\ Picture Processing Unit (Ricoh 2C02)
 CONSTANT PPU-BASE
0x2000 CONSTANT PPU-PPUCTRL
7 CONSTANT PPU-PPUCTRL-NMI  \ VBlank NMI enable
6 CONSTANT PPU-PPUCTRL-MASTERSLAVE  \ Master/slave select
5 CONSTANT PPU-PPUCTRL-SPRITESIZE  \ Sprite size (0=8x8, 1=8x16)
