  ." 系列: " FAMILY TYPE CR
  ." 版本: " VERSION TYPE CR
  ." 架构: " ARCHITECTURE TYPE CR
  ." 位宽: " BITS . CR
  ." 时钟: " CLOCK-FREQ . ." Hz" CR
;

